cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this template, or a project built from it, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Plumber: a minimalistic ML pipeline template"
authors:
  - given-names: Aurelio
    family-names: Raffa Ugolini
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-1545-374X"
repository-code: "https://github.com/aurelio-raffa/plumber"
abstract: >-
  A minimalistic template for machine-learning pipelines: each pipeline is a readable YAML file
  of stages with obvious inputs and outputs, executed with MLflow so that the execution of the
  code is tracked while the project is developed.
keywords:
  - machine learning
  - pipelines
  - MLflow
  - reproducibility
  - template
